    "detailed_description": "<h1>Season  : Esper</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/b0c099e8cbcefd69129ef21418499627.poster.avif?t=1736924584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/b0c099e8cbcefd69129ef21418499627.webm?t=1736924584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/b0c099e8cbcefd69129ef21418499627.mp4?t=1736924584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Alien  fight against the Red lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Key Features: </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/234bae3a59380234e4cab6a869fd9674.poster.avif?t=1736924584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/234bae3a59380234e4cab6a869fd9674.webm?t=1736924584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>    Hauntingly beautiful vistas and locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Freedom and Liberty  -Do whatever you want in a massive open world with hundreds of locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exotic Weapons  \u2013 Players will obtain a variety of weapon types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Explore-  Explore Galaxy City .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">     Galaxy City Map- Simple Galaxy City Map for easy progress and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        Teleportation Tower - Simple Teleportation Tower for Progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">       <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/2773d3a3f52d2651fb1911ec45fb06d8.poster.avif?t=1736924584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800650/extras/2773d3a3f52d2651fb1911ec45fb06d8.webm?t=1736924584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        Great Soundtrack- Game has incredible orchestral  and Electronic music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Setting</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy is suffering from Dark age,where life is cheap,there is no economy and culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy City  - Galaxy City is the capital of Trantord And Galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trantord - Trantord is planet where green people lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terminus- Red lord has lost war at planet terminus..</p>",
